  "content": {
    "prompt": "In the following code, catch the NumberFormatException that is thrown when the argument of Integer.parseInt does not represent a number.",
    "source_code": "// TODO: Determine whether a or b do not represent an integer\n// by catching the NumberFormatException. If either one is not an integer,\n// use the value 0 when computing the sum.\n\npublic class Numbers\n{\n   public int add(String a, String b)\n   {\n      int x = Integer.parseInt(a);\n      int y = Integer.parseInt(b);\n      return x + y;\n   }\n}"
  },
